OL,3,ABurnham says it is 'clear' Russia
OL,4,Ainterfered with Brexit vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said Russia did
OL,7,Finterfere with the Brexit referendum
OL,8,Fand warned that similar activities were
OL,9,Ftaking place in France and Germany.
OL,11,FThe prime minister told The Rest is
OL,12,FPolitics podcast that upon arriving in
OL,13,FNo 10, he had asked about possible
OL,14,FRussian interference in the 2016 vote,
OL,15,Fadding: "I've had the clear answer
OL,16,Fthat, yes, there was."
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
