OL,3,ABurnham says it is 'clear' Russia
OL,4,Ainterfered with Brexit vote
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think we've been too much on the
OL,7,Fback foot on that actually and we
OL,8,Fhaven't informed people sufficiently
OL,9,Fabout the extent to which people are
OL,10,Fseeking to disrupt the political
OL,11,Fprocess from overseas," he added.
OL,13,FBurnham did not provide further details
OL,14,Fabout the type or extent of Moscow's
OL,15,Factivity during the Brexit referendum.
